# IF-13: keep caches, local virtualenvs and secrets out of the image build context (the Dockerfile copies only
# app/, scripts/, alembic.ini, pyproject.toml, constraints.txt and, for the dev target, tests/).
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov
.venv
venv
.env
.env.*
*.dump
*.sql.gz
